oriya/Housing-Price-Prediction","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"House prices increase every year, so there is a need for a system to predict house prices in the future. House price prediction can help the developer determine the selling price of a house and can help the customer to arrange the right time to purchase a house. There are three factors that influence the price of a house which include physical conditions, concept and location. This project aims to predict house prices. Proudly created by Harsh Nagoriya","topics":[],"score":222177,"global_rank":183130},{"name":"harshnagoriya/Iris-flowers-classification","owner":"harshnagoriya","html_url":"https://github.com/harshnagoriya/Iris-flowers-classification","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"The aim of this project is to classify iris flowers among three species (setosa, versicolor or virginica) from measurements of length and width of sepals and petals.","topics":[],"score":222177,"global_rank":183131},{"name":"jianhui-ben/visitor_management_system","owner":"jianhui-ben","html_url":"https://github.com/jianhui-ben/visitor_management_system","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"visitor_management_system using Python and Flask","topics":[],"score":222177,"global_rank":183137},{"name":"aarontuor/fire","owner":"aarontuor","html_url":"https://github.com/aarontuor/fire","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":222177,"global_rank":183144},{"name":"i-am-SR/IRIS-classification-using-kNN","owner":"i-am-SR","html_url":"https://github.com/i-am-SR/IRIS-classification-using-kNN","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Classification of flowers in IRIS dataset using kNN","topics":[],"score":222177,"global_rank":183165},{"name":"mpHarm88/blackbox",